    exBundleDyn_hypsAt oracle C_lsst hLSST, exBundleDyn_instHyps oracle C_lsst hLSST, hm_poly⟩

/-- **Unconditional non-vacuity for `bundleLemma_5_17_mwu`** (`μ = 2`),
